					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>There must be no shosts.equiv files on the RHEL 8 operating system.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The shosts.equiv files are used to configure host-based authentication for the system via SSH. Host-based authentication is not sufficient for preventing unauthorized access to the system.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
